{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":20.520000457763672,"text":"A little below the main sanctuary, on a slope of olive trees, three columns stand holding up a curved piece of roof. They belonged to a round building from the 4th century BC that had 20 columns all the way around it. It is the most photographed image of Delphi and the biggest question mark on the site. Nobody knows what it was for.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.47999998927116394},{"word":"little","start":0.47999998927116394,"end":0.6800000071525574},{"word":"below","start":0.6800000071525574,"end":1.059999942779541},{"word":"the","start":1.059999942779541,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"main","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.659999966621399},{"word":"sanctuary","start":1.659999966621399,"end":2.140000104904175},{"word":"on","start":2.5199999809265137,"end":2.619999885559082},{"word":"a","start":2.619999885559082,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"slope","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"of","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.359999895095825},{"word":"olive","start":3.359999895095825,"end":3.559999942779541},{"word":"trees","start":3.559999942779541,"end":3.9000000953674316},{"word":"three","start":4.380000114440918,"end":4.639999866485596},{"word":"columns","start":4.639999866485596,"end":5},{"word":"stand","start":5,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"holding","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.78000020980835},{"word":"up","start":5.78000020980835,"end":6.059999942779541},{"word":"a","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.21999979019165},{"word":"curved","start":6.21999979019165,"end":6.440000057220459},{"word":"piece","start":6.440000057220459,"end":6.800000190734863},{"word":"of","start":6.800000190734863,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"roof","start":7.260000228881836,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"They","start":7.840000152587891,"end":7.940000057220459},{"word":"belonged","start":7.940000057220459,"end":8.260000228881836},{"word":"to","start":8.26